BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dry-january-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270201
SUMMARY:Dry January #DryJanuary
DESCRIPTION:A month off alcohol. The ask: Go alcohol-free for January. Or
 ganiser: Alcohol Change UK. Join only if you offer alcohol-free options o
 r support people taking part. Watch out: Alcohol brands should sit this o
 ut. No health claims. https://alcoholchange.org.uk
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:veganuary-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270201
SUMMARY:Veganuary #Veganuary
DESCRIPTION:Plant-based eating. The ask: Try vegan for January. Organiser
 : Veganuary (charity). Join only if you sell or make plant-based products
 \, or your team is genuinely taking part. Watch out: No health claims you
  can't prove. Don't call a product vegan unless it is. https://veganuary.
 com
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:education-day-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270124
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270125
SUMMARY:International Day of Education #EducationDay
DESCRIPTION:Education as a human right. The ask: Support access to learni
 ng. Organiser: United Nations (UNESCO leads). Join only if you teach\, fu
 nd learning or make learning tools. Watch out: Avoid making it a sales po
 st. https://www.un.org/en/observances/education-day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:black-history-month-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270301
SUMMARY:Black History Month (US) #BlackHistoryMonth
DESCRIPTION:Black history and achievement. The ask: Learn\, celebrate and
  support Black communities. Organiser: Theme set by ASALH\, the Associati
 on for the Study of African American Life and History. Join only if you c
 an show real support beyond February: partners\, suppliers\, giving\, peo
 ple. Watch out: Tokenism backfires. No logo-only posts. Watch the US poli
 tical climate and keep the focus on people. https://asalh.org
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:safer-internet-day-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270209
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270210
SUMMARY:Safer Internet Day #SaferInternetDay
DESCRIPTION:A safer\, better internet\, especially for young people. The 
 ask: Learn and share online safety habits. Organiser: Insafe network for 
 the European Commission\, with national centres such as eSafety (AU) and 
 Netsafe (NZ). Join only if you build or run something people use online. 
 Watch out: Don't overstate your security. Point to official guidance. htt
 ps://better-internet-for-kids.europa.eu/en/events/safer-internet-day-sid-
 2027
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:zero-discrimination-day-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270302
SUMMARY:Zero Discrimination Day #ZeroDiscrimination
DESCRIPTION:Equality before the law and in practice. The ask: Speak up ag
 ainst discrimination. Organiser: UNAIDS. Join only if your policies back 
 up what you post. Watch out: Words without policies read as empty. https:
 //www.unaids.org/en/zero-discrimination-day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
