UID:world-wildlife-day-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270303
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270304
SUMMARY:World Wildlife Day #WorldWildlifeDay
DESCRIPTION:Wild animals and plants. The ask: Learn about and protect wil
 dlife. Organiser: United Nations (CITES secretariat). Join only if you wo
 rk with or near nature\, or fund conservation. Watch out: Avoid claims of
  impact you can't measure. https://www.un.org/en/observances/world-wildli
 fe-day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
