UID:clean-up-australia-day-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270307
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270308
SUMMARY:Clean Up Australia Day #CleanUpAustraliaDay
DESCRIPTION:Rubbish-free places. The ask: Register or join a local clean-
 up. Organiser: Clean Up Australia. Join only if your team will actually t
 urn up and clean up. Watch out: Show the work\, not the logo. https://www
 .cleanup.org.au
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:international-womens-day-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270308
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270309
SUMMARY:International Women's Day #IWD2027
DESCRIPTION:Women's rights and gender equality. The ask: Celebrate women 
 and act for equality. Organiser: United Nations (UN Women)\, with the int
 ernationalwomensday.com campaign. Join only if you can show women in your
  business\, customers or supply chain\, and what you're doing for equalit
 y. Watch out: Quote cards without action get called out. Check claims abo
 ut pay and representation. https://www.un.org/en/observances/womens-day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:earth-hour-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270320
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270321
SUMMARY:Earth Hour #EarthHour
DESCRIPTION:Climate and nature. The ask: Switch off non-essential lights 
 for an hour. Organiser: WWF. Join only if you will actually switch off (s
 igns\, stores\, office) and can show it. Watch out: Switching off for an 
 hour isn't a climate strategy. Say what else you do. https://www.earthhou
 r.org
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:international-day-of-happiness-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270320
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270321
SUMMARY:International Day of Happiness #InternationalDayOfHappiness
DESCRIPTION:Wellbeing and happiness as a goal. The ask: Do one thing that
  makes someone happier. Organiser: United Nations\, with Action for Happi
 ness. Join only if you can add something useful\, not just a smile. Watch
  out: Avoid mental health claims. https://www.un.org/en/observances/happi
 ness-day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:world-water-day-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270322
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270323
SUMMARY:World Water Day #WorldWaterDay
DESCRIPTION:Fresh water and sanitation. The ask: Use less and protect wat
 er. Organiser: UN-Water. Join only if water use is part of your business.
  Watch out: Back water-saving claims with numbers. https://www.un.org/en/
 observances/water-day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:world-health-day-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270407
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270408
SUMMARY:World Health Day #WorldHealthDay
DESCRIPTION:Health for all. The ask: Take one step for your health or oth
 ers'. Organiser: World Health Organization. Join only if you have a healt
 h role and can stay within regulated claims. Watch out: Health claims are
  regulated. Stay general and point to official advice. https://www.who.in
 t/campaigns/world-health-day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:earth-day-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270422
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270423
SUMMARY:Earth Day #EarthDay
DESCRIPTION:Environmental protection. 2027 theme: Food for Our Planet (pl
 ant-based diets and food labels). The ask: Take one action for the planet
 \, this year on food. Organiser: EARTHDAY.ORG (UN: International Mother E
 arth Day). Join only if you can point to a real change in how you source\
 , make or package. Watch out: Greenwashing. Every green claim needs proof
 . https://www.earthday.org
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fashion-revolution-week-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270424
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270425
SUMMARY:Fashion Revolution Week #WhoMadeMyClothes
DESCRIPTION:A fair\, transparent fashion industry\; marks the Rana Plaza 
 collapse (24 Apr 2013). The ask: Ask brands #WhoMadeMyClothes\; mend and 
 rewear. Organiser: Fashion Revolution. Join only if you can answer who ma
 de your clothes\, by name or by factory. Watch out: If you can't answer t
 he question\, don't ask it. Dates for 2027 not yet announced\; the UK HQ 
 closed in 2026 and the movement now runs through its global network. http
 s://www.fashionrevolution.org
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mental-health-awareness-month-2027@mavic.ai
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270601
SUMMARY:Mental Health Awareness Month (US) #MentalHealthMonth
DESCRIPTION:Mental health awareness and access to care. The ask: Talk abo
 ut it\, check in\, find support. Organiser: Mental Health America. Join o
 nly if you support\, not sell: you have a policy\, a resource or a partne
 r to share. Watch out: Support\, don't sell. No therapeutic claims. Alway
 s link official services. https://mhanational.org
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
